WEBVTT

00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:04.653
The opening tree shows every opening your opponent plays, and how often.

00:00:05.103 --> 00:00:07.828
On your opponent's page, tap Opening Tree.

00:00:08.278 --> 00:00:14.821
It shows how many games the tree is built from. Here, 656, over the board and online.

00:00:15.271 --> 00:00:21.708
These are their first moves as White. e4, in 65% of games. Tap a move to follow it.

00:00:22.158 --> 00:00:26.504
Now you see what their opponents replied. Tap c5, the Sicilian.

00:00:26.954 --> 00:00:33.433
Against the Sicilian, he plays Nf3, 92% of the time. Now you know what to expect.

00:00:33.883 --> 00:00:37.931
Every game in the line is listed below, to open, or download.

00:00:38.381 --> 00:00:42.001
Switch to As Black, for their repertoire with the black pieces.

00:00:42.451 --> 00:00:45.411
Prepare for both colours, before the round starts.

00:00:45.861 --> 00:00:49.076
Know their openings. chesspreparatory.com.
